<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Versioning on Cribl Python SDK</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/sdks/versioning/</link><description>Recent content in Versioning on Cribl Python SDK</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/sdks/versioning/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Branches</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/sdks/versioning/branches/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/sdks/versioning/branches/</guid><description>&lt;p class="breadcrumb"&gt;Versioning › Branches&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;versioning.branches&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Branch operations&lt;/p&gt;
