&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;versioning.configs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Config operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;client.versioning.configs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="get"&gt;get&lt;a class="anchor" href="#get"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
&lt;button type="button" class="code-copy" data-label="Copy" aria-label="Copy code" hidden&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;client.versioning.configs.get(...)
await client.versioning.configs.get_async(...)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get the configuration and status for the Git integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get the configuration and versioning status for the Git integration for the Cribl configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="example-usage"&gt;Example Usage&lt;a class="anchor" href="#example-usage"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
