			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Git integration info — Response&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Statuses</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/sdks/versioning/statuses/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/sdks/versioning/statuses/</guid><description>&lt;p class="breadcrumb"&gt;Versioning › Statuses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;versioning.statuses&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Status operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;client.versioning.statuses&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="get"&gt;get&lt;a class="anchor" href="#get"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
&lt;button type="button" class="code-copy" data-label="Copy" aria-label="Copy code" hidden&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;client.versioning.statuses.get(...)
await client.versioning.statuses.get_async(...)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get the status of the current working tree.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get the status of the current working tree of the Git repository used for Cribl configuration. The response includes details about modified, staged, untracked, and conflicted files, as well as branch and remote tracking information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="example-usage"&gt;Example Usage&lt;a class="anchor" href="#example-usage"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
